	<li>Tai-Li Wang (2017), Two Civic Movements, two destinies? A comparative study of the roles of social media in Taiwan&rsquo;s Sunflower Movement and Hong Kong&rsquo;s Umbrella Movement, paper presented in Asian Conference on Media, Communication &amp; Film, Kobe, Japan.</li>
	<li>王泰俐 (2015), 群眾心理對公民運動參與的影響，第七屆國會學術:公民憲政vs.代議政治，東吳大學，台北。</li>
	<li>王泰俐(2015), 科技部社會學門成果發表會－公民與政治，中華傳播學會，高雄義守大學。</li>
	<li>Wang, T. L. (2013).The Potential Political Impacts of Social Media during elections: the Implication of Taiwan&rsquo;s case on Asian Countries, ICA</li>
